diation \"Configure an API key or bearer on the default model's gptel backend\") (:id anthropic-auth :label \"Claude OAuth cache\" :category auth :status info :detail \"No Claude OAuth token file found\" :remediation \"Run M-x ogent-anthropic-login to refresh the OAuth tokens\") (:id br :label \"br issue tracker\" :category cli :status warn :detail \"br executable not found in PATH\" :remediation \"Install br (beads_rust) and put it on PATH for issue integration\") (:id adapter-clis :label \"Adapter CLIs\" :category cli :status info :detail \"Codex CLI: codex not in PATH\nClaude Code: claude not in PATH\nGemini CLI: gemini not in PATH\nCursor Agent: cursor-agent not in PATH\nOpenCode: opencode not in PATH\nPi CLI: unsupported - pi CLI invocation flags are unverified (no local pi --help to ground them)\nGrok CLI: unsupported - grok CLI invocation flags are unverified (no local grok --help to ground them)\nGitHub Copilot: copilot not in PATH\ngptel (in-process): in-process, no CLI needed\" :remediation \"Install the adapter CLIs you plan to run through the Armory\") (:id curl :label \"curl transport\" :category transport :status ok :detail \"curl found at /usr/bin/curl\" :remediation \"Install curl to enable streaming MCP HTTP transport\") (:id org-ql :label \"org-ql package\" :category optional :status info :detail \"org-ql is not installed; installing it unlocks saved-query search over Armory conversations (ogent-armory-ql)\" :remediation nil) (:id vterm :label \"vterm package\" :category optional :status info :detail \"vterm is not installed; installing it unlocks full terminal emulation for interactive CLI agent sessions (the Armory terminal runtime otherwise uses term.el)\" :remediation nil) (:id markdown-mode :label \"markdown-mode package\" :category optional :status ok :detail \"markdown-mode is available\" :remediation nil) (:id analytics-db :label \"Analytics DB\" :category stores :status info :detail \"No analytics DB for this project (/work/.ogent-analytics.db)\" :remediation \"Move the corrupt analytics DB aside; ogent recreates it on next use\") (:id stale-elc :label \"Stale .elc files\" :category environment :status ok :detail \"No ogent .elc compiled by an Emacs newer than 30\" :remediation \"Recompile ogent with the running Emacs, or move the newer-Emacs .elc aside\"))"}
